{"title": "Enlarge", "pageid": 2378, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Enlarge", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 2 Spells", "Transmutation spells", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Enlarge_(Duergar)\" title=\"Enlarge (Duergar)\">Enlarge (Duergar)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Enlarge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Enlarge.webp/300px-Enlarge.webp, /w/images/e/e4/Enlarge.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Enlarge.webp/300px-Enlarge.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Enlarge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Enlarge </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 2 transmutation spell</a>. This spell allows spellcasters to increase a creature's body size. Affected creatures deal more damage with their weapons and gain <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Make a creature larger.\n</p>\nIts weapons deal an extra <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>1d4</b> damage. It has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 2 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Enlarge</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Enlarge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Enlarge\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Enlarged\"> Condition: Enlarged </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enlarged_(Condition)\" title=\"Enlarged (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enlarged\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enlarged_(Condition)\" title=\"Enlarged (Condition)\">Enlarged</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Creature_Size\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creature Size\">Size</a> is increased.</li>\n<li>Weapon attacks deal <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>1d4</b> more damage. Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enlarge/Reduce\" title=\"Enlarge/Reduce\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp/40px-Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp/60px-Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp/80px-Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enlarge/Reduce\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp/40px-Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Enlarge_Reduce_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Enlarge/Reduce\" title=\"Enlarge/Reduce\">Enlarge/Reduce</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> only applies when the spell is cast on a non-party member.</li>\n<li>When <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">Duergar</a> cast this spell as a racial ability, it can only be cast once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a> but notably does not require <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> as of <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_Notes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Patch Notes\">Patch 3</a>.</li>\n<li>Enlarge increases the target creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Creature_Size\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creature Size\">size</a> to the next higher category. For example, a <a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a> creature becomes <a href=\"/wiki/Large\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Large\">Large</a>. This also increases the scale of the creature's model by 33%.</li>\n<li>Enlarged creatures can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/38px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/50px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shove</a> significantly heavier objects. Refer to <a href=\"/wiki/Shove#Max_weight\" title=\"Shove\">max shove weight</a> for details.</li>\n<li>On the other hand, Enlarge does not affect the weight of objects that can be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Thrown</a> or wielded as a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a>.</li>\n<li>Enlarge also increases the weight of the target creature to 2.35 × original weight. If the new weight is below the minimum weight of the new size category (e.g. 200 kg if increased to <a href=\"/wiki/Large\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Large\">Large</a>), the weight is set to the minimum value for that category. See <a href=\"/wiki/Creature_Size\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creature Size\">Creature Size</a> for more information.</li>\n<li>The incantations for Enlarge are <i>Gigans</i> (\"Giant\") and <i>Extende</i> (\"Extend\").</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite not being mentioned in the condition description, unarmed attacks, but not those made while transformed by Wild Shape, are affected by Enlarge.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/b/bb/Enlarge_Reduce_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Enlarge_Reduce_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Enlarge_Reduce_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Enlarge/reduce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enlarge/reduce\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Enlarge/reduce\">Enlarge/reduce</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \n